VII. CONCLUSION & FUTURE SCOPE
In conclusion, the development of the college's indoor navigation system, built using Unity, QR code pathfinding, Vuforia augmented reality, and LiDAR sensor technologies, represents a game-changing answer to campus navigation difficulties. This project has significantly enhanced the user experience by seamlessly integrating real-time location tracking and interactive augmented reality guidance. The implementation of QR code pathfinding algorithms ensures optimal route planning, taking into account essential factors like distance, accessibility, and real-time obstacles. With its user-friendly interface, precise navigation capabilities, and attention to accessibility, this indoor navigation system not only simplifies the complexities of navigating the college environment but also sets a standard for innovative and inclusive technological solutions in educational institutions.

